// Tape — the wire contract.
//
// A durable-execution substrate for ADK agents. See ../../design-principles/tape.md.
//
// Flexible payloads (model requests/responses, tool args/results, event content,
// state values, compensation payloads) are carried as JSON strings. This keeps
// the contract small and the cross-language SDKs honest: the server treats them
// as opaque blobs; only the agent's own code interprets them.
//
